# Task 2 implementation report — entry-attempt outcome counts

## Status

Implemented on base `33a5fde`.

## Change

Updated `core/backtest_engine.py::print_pnl_report` with an additive `Entry
Attempt Outcomes` section after the existing execution diagnostics. The
section counts `SimulationResult.entry_outcomes[*].outcome`, prints outcome
names in sorted order with deterministic counts, and prints a harmless
`No entry attempts recorded.` message when the outcome list is empty.

No entry qualification, sizing, cadence, checkpoint, serialization,
optimizer, SEC, or 13F behavior was changed.

## Verification

- `python -m py_compile core/backtest_engine.py` — passed.
- Bounded direct report invocation with three immutable outcomes — printed
  `alpha: 2` before `zeta: 1`, confirming aggregation and sorting.
- Bounded direct report invocation with the default empty outcome list —
  printed the section and `No entry attempts recorded.` without error.

No tests were added, and no data was downloaded.

## Concerns

None identified within the requested scope.
